{"id": "34190", "title": "霸王的女奴(再见王朝1)", "author": "白双", "category": "文学名著", "count": 39, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34190/34190s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34190.htm", "intro": "老编派她去印度采访什么“新蒙兀儿王朝” ，她却被来接机的人带到又乱又脏的市街，莫名其妙被囚禁了起来。被人摆在台上当货品叫卖。正当底下的人喊价喊得不亦乐乎时，又一阵混乱，她就被带到这个男人面前了。他，酷帅有型、一派王者风范，可却霸道异常，硬是不让她离开。说要帮她办证件好让她回台湾，却要她留在他的“古德塔”当两个月奴隶......?? 犯上他。可恶，台湾的女人都像她这样吗？等着瞧吧！此仇不报他誓不为人，他一定要让她在演艺圈“永不超生”……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34190", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2172570.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2172571.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2172572.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2172573.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2172574.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2172575.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2172576.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2172577.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2172578.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2172579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2172580.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2172581.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2172582.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2172583.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2172584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2172585.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2172586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2172587.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2172588.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2172589.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2172590.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2172591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2172592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2172593.html", "available": fa